8\",\"text\":\"Telegram / Discord / others\",\"translated\":\"Telegram / Discord / 其他\",\"provider\":\"pi\",\"model\":\"claude-opus-4-5\",\"src_lang\":\"en\",\"tgt_lang\":\"zh-CN\",\"updated_at\":\"2026-02-01T13:37:17Z\"}\r\nC:\\Users\\yanmeizhao\\AppData\\Roaming\\npm\\node_modules\\openclaw\\docs\\.i18n\\zh-CN.tm.jsonl:741: {\"cache_key\":\"93114bd8806e7d10e3c22b3415d23eec041357c24c8f6dc651d62cacc41ad375\",\"segment_id\":\"start/getting-started.md:69c1cae4e20f3b2b\",\"source_path\":\"start/getting-started.md\",\"text_hash\":\"69c1cae4e20f3b2b4d3b3dd3ea7636d8faed8460af512aa7a7d3a3c09696f5fc\",\"text\":\" Bun has known issues with these\\nchannels. If you use WhatsApp or Telegram, run the Gateway with \",\"translated\":\" Bun 在这些渠道上存在已知问题。如果您使用 WhatsApp 或 Telegram，请使用 \",\"provider\":\"pi\",\"model\":\"claude-opus-4-5\",\"src_lang\":\"en\",\"tgt_lang\":\"zh-CN\",\"updated_at\":\"2026-02-01T13:37:03Z\"}\r\nC:\\Users\\yanmeizhao\\AppData\\Roaming\\npm\\node_modules\\openclaw\\docs\\.i18n\\zh-CN.tm.jsonl:747: {\"cache_key\":\"93f8819a09c973fae0ec648305d9c7e50ebee3771359b807686c605023b0b705\",\"segment_id\":\"start/getting-started.md:eba2ed5d6cc0239d\",\"source_path\":\"start/getting-started.md\",\"text_hash\":\"eba2ed5d6cc0239dd5d0475d7ea57b120ff06eb1100c67f4cf713c3bb167f0a0\",\"text\":\": Node (recommended; required for WhatsApp/Telegram). Bun is \",\"translated\":\"：Node（推荐；WhatsApp/Telegram 必需）。Bun 为 \",\"provider\":\"pi\",\"model\":\"claude-opus-4-5\",\"src_lang\":\"en\",\"tgt_lang\":\"zh-CN\",\"updated_at\":\"2026-02-01T13:36:19Z\"}\r\nC:\\Users\\yanmeizhao\\AppData\\Roaming\\npm\\node_modules\\openclaw\\docs\\.i18n\\zh-CN.tm.jsonl:787: {\"cache_key\":\"9bb6f5ad39ff9d7aff3bca1fda6f474e19f25c0ffaaffaf3b19c924234d8c03a\",\"segment_id\":\"index.md:f0d82ba647b4a33d\",\"source_path\":\"index.md\",\"text_hash\":\"f0d82ba647b4a33da3008927253f9bed21e380f54eab0608b1136de4cbff1286\",\"text\":\"OpenClaw bridges WhatsApp (via WhatsApp Web / Baileys), Telegram (Bot API / grammY), Discord (Bot API / channels.discord.js), and iMessage (imsg CLI) to coding agents like \",\"translated\":\"OpenClaw 将 WhatsApp（通过 WhatsApp Web / Baileys）、Telegram（Bot API / grammY）、Discord（Bot API / 渠道.discord.js）和 iMessage（imsg CLI）桥接到编程 智能体，例如 \",\"provider\":\"pi\",\"model\":\"claude-opus-4-5\",\"src_lang\":\"en\",\"tgt_lang\":\"zh-CN\",\"updated_at\":\"2026-02-01T12:47:31Z\"}\r\nC:\\Users\\yanmeizhao\\AppData\\Roaming\\npm\\node_modules\\openclaw\\docs\\.i18n\\zh-CN.tm.jsonl:826: {\"cache_key\":\"a2c462e51d228b070aba2a14a09d41aa54e0962d795724d5a090c71c7e242dfe\",\"segment_id\":\"start/getting-started.md:acdd1e734125f341\",\"source_path\":\"start/getting-started.md\",\"text_hash\":\"acdd1e734125f341604c0efbabdcc4c4b0597e8f6235d66c2445edd1812838c1\",\"text\":\"Telegram\",\"translated\":\"Telegram\",\"provider\":\"pi\",\"model\":\"claude-opus-4-5\",\"src_lang\":\"en\",\"tgt_lang\":\"zh-CN\",\"updated_at\":\"2026-02-01T13:37:22Z\"}\r\nC:\\Users\\yanmeizhao\\AppData\\Roaming\\npm\\node_modules\\openclaw\\docs\\.i18n\\zh-CN.tm.jsonl:848: {\"cache_key\":\"a626e7fe04bc58aa97f7363efbdaa14d5804691b203594e954e7373d26bc5bbb\",\"segment_id\":\"start/getting-started.md:f68f6c2d3e9114cf\",\"source_path\":\"start/getting-started.md\",\"text_hash\":\"f68f6c2d3e9114cfec906d6a20cd048091e580c6e1d00a8066165dba188f9b3e\",\"text\":\"channels (WhatsApp/Telegram/Discord/Mattermost (plugin)/...)\",\"translated\":\"渠道（WhatsApp/Telegram/Discord/Mattermost（插件）/...）\",\"provider\":\"pi\",\"model\":\"claude-opus-4-5\",\"src_lang\":\"en\",\"tgt_lang\":\"zh-CN\",\"updated_at\":\"2026-02-01T13:34:56Z\"}\r\nC:\\Users\\yanmeizhao\\AppData\\Roaming\\npm\\node_modules\\openclaw\\docs\\.i18n\\zh-CN.tm.jsonl:867: {\"cache_key\":\"aacffcbc2a97abf1a5eccd00e5893be1125e364251fa27f3e0c88ef2db2b0248\",\"segment_id\":\"index.md:acdd1e734125f341\",\"source_path\":\"index.md\",\"text_hash\":\"acdd1e734125f341604c0efbabdcc4c4b0597e8f6235d66c2445edd1812838c1\",\"text\":\"Telegram\",\"translated\":\"Telegram\",\"provider\":\"pi\",\"model\":\"claude-opus-4-5\",\"src_lang\":\"en\",\"tgt_lang\":\"zh-CN\",\"updated_at\":\"2026-02-01T13:32:36Z\"}\r\nC:\\Users\\yanmeizhao\\AppData\\Roaming\\npm\\node_modules\\openclaw\\docs\\.i18n\\zh-CN.tm.jsonl:934: {\"cache_key\":\"b5687bd5a0443bd1ccaa45996bbe3a784f66fa059e4aa68048a14712f853d56e\",\"segment_id\":\"start/wizard.md:5f6a8991209034d4\",\"source_path\":\"start/wizard.md\",\"text_hash\":\"5f6a8991209034d4d6473c75e2f74dc3df90cc6cde2723d7d25085dbfc3fad24\",\"text\":\"Providers (Telegram, WhatsApp, Discord, Google Chat, Mattermost (plugin), Signal)\",\"translated\":\"提供商（Telegram、WhatsApp、Discord、Google Chat、Mattermost（插件）、Signal）\",\"provider\":\"pi\",\"model\":\"claude-opus-4-5\",\"src_lang\":\"en\",\"tgt_lang\":\"zh-CN\",\"updated_at\":\"2026-02-01T13:40:26Z\"}\r\nC:\\Users\\yanmeizhao\\AppData\\Roaming\\npm\\node_modules\\openclaw\\docs\\.i18n\\zh-CN.tm.jsonl:946: {\"cache_key\":\"b7c642921d34922bbb25206e04a52428c8707414d90f0aa9bbc07366d3165e09\",\"segment_id\":\"start/getting-started.md:73526fff31f4fa0a\",\"source_path\":\"start/getting-started.md\",\"text_hash\":\"73526fff31f4fa0a98e4e135e0610652867bd8842a6abeb821e02ee87842bb96\",\"text\":\"Telegram DM tip:\",\"translated\":\"Telegram 私信提示：\",\"provider\":\"pi\",\"model\":\"claude-opus-4-5\",\"src_lang\":\"en\",\"tgt_lang\":\"zh-CN\",\"updated_at\":\"2026-02-01T13:37:33Z\"}\r\nC:\\Users\\yanmeizhao\\AppData\\Roaming\\npm\\node_modules\\openclaw\\docs\\.i18n\\zh-CN.tm.jsonl:1010: {\"cache_key\":\"c3c32ca9a6e0b7331bd674903379664ef8c5ab9f675dbb531062af512452343e\",\"segment_id\":\"index.md:acdd1e734125f341\",\"source_path\":\"index.md\",\"text_hash\":\"acdd1e734125f341604c0efbabdcc4c4b0597e8f6235d66c2445edd1812838c1\",\"text\":\"Telegram\",\"translated\":\"Telegram\",\"provider\":\"pi\",\"model\":\"claude-opus-4-5\",\"src_lang\":\"en\",\"tgt_lang\":\"zh-CN\",\"updated_at\":\"2026-02-01T13:04:46Z\"}\r\nC:\\Users\\yanmeizhao\\AppData\\Roaming\\npm\\node_modules\\openclaw\\docs\\.i18n\\zh-CN.tm.jsonl:1040: {\"cache_key\":\"c982edd40183708dbf5bc791228db4bfd5b4b33d5a623e1173ee48a697e31c6f\",\"segment_id\":\"index.md:f12242785ecda793\",\"source_path\":\"index.md\",\"text_hash\":\"f12242785ecda7935ded50cd48418357d32d3bac290f7a199bc9f0c7fbd13123\",\"text\":\") — Location parsing (Telegram + WhatsApp)\",\"translated\":\"）—— 位置解析（Telegram + WhatsApp）\",\"provider\":\"pi\",\"model\":\"claude-opus-4-5\",\"src_lang\":\"en\",\"tgt_lang\":\"zh-CN\",\"updated_at\":\"2026-02-01T12:54:56Z\"}\r\nC:\\Users\\yanmeizhao\\AppData\\Roaming\\npm\\node_modules\\openclaw\\docs\\.i18n\\zh-CN.tm.jsonl:1148: {\"cache_key\":\"deab7aa2d56c6fe242f6f04eef414a3fed9e1ac64374fcba6ed245d7b2733f6b\",\"segment_id\":\"start/getting-started.md:e0626242c2ea510e\",\"source_path\":\"start/getting-started.md\",\"text_hash\":\"e0626242c2ea510e9457d6fb1b2848fe7091b10201c13d28c9774e6450ad28b2\",\"text\":\": WhatsApp QR login, Telegram/Discord bot tokens, Mattermost plugin tokens, etc.\",\"translated\":\"：WhatsApp 二维码登录、Telegram/Discord 机器人令牌、Mattermost 插件令牌等。\",\"provider\":\"pi\",\"model\":\"claude-opus-4-5\",\"src_lang\":\"en\",\"tgt_lang\":\"zh-CN\",\"updated_at\":\"2026-02-01T13:36:11Z\"}\r\nC:\\Users\\yanmeizhao\\AppData\\Roaming\\npm\\node_modules\\openclaw\\docs\\.i18n\\zh-CN.tm.jsonl:1191: {\"cache_key\":\"e6e456289628d5a4b6cbbc0fbb263d656ba7d49427a2009ce3c5f608b8505ea0\",\"segment_id\":\"index.md:f0d82ba647b4a33d\",\"source_path\":\"index.md\",\"text_hash\":\"f0d82ba647b4a33da3008927253f9bed21e380f54eab0608b1136de4cbff1286\",\"text\":\"OpenClaw bridges WhatsApp (via WhatsApp Web / Baileys), Telegram (Bot API / grammY), Discord (Bot API / channels.discord.js), and iMessage (imsg CLI) to coding agents like \",\"translated\":\"OpenClaw 将 WhatsApp（通过 WhatsApp Web / Baileys）、Telegram（Bot API / grammY）、Discord（Bot API / channels.discord.js）和 iMessage（imsg CLI）桥接到编程 智能体，例如 \",\"provider\":\"pi\",\"model\":\"claude-opus-4-5\",\"src_lang\":\"en\",\"tgt_lang\":\"zh-CN\",\"updated_at\":\"2026-02-01T12:58:56Z\"}\r\nC:\\Users\\yanmeizhao\\AppData\\Roaming\\npm\\node_modules\\openclaw\\docs\\.i18n\\zh-CN.tm.jsonl:1298: {\"cache_key\":\"faae749a1e3720731bd89450cc30ca39d65ca2d3968ac048373c3f6ba5087381\",\"segment_id\":\"start/getting-started.md:9c7c1a1750d380e8\",\"source_path\":\"start/getting-started.md\",\"text_hash\":\"9c7c1a1750d380e8b4f5329437dd3e6066f20891e74af700595ddf8a5eac42a3\",\"text\":\"Bun warning (WhatsApp + Telegram):\",\"translated\":\"Bun 警告（WhatsApp + Telegram）：\",\"provider\":\"pi\",\"model\":\"claude-opus-4-5\",\"src_lang\":\"en\",\"tgt_lang\":\"zh-CN\",\"updated_at\":\"2026-02-01T13:37:01Z\"}\r\nC:\\Users\\yanmeizhao\\AppData\\Roaming\\npm\\node_modules\\openclaw\\docs\\automation\\cron-jobs.md:252: - `delivery.channel`: `whatsapp` / `telegram` / `discord` / `slack` / `mattermost` (plugin) / `signal` / `imessage` / `last`.\r\nC:\\Users\\yanmeizhao\\AppData\\Roaming\\npm\\node_modules\\openclaw\\docs\\automation\\cron-jobs.md:264: - Telegram topics should use the `:topic:` form (see below).\r\nC:\\Users\\yanmeizhao\\AppData\\Roaming\\npm\\node_modules\\openclaw\\docs\\automation\\cron-jobs.md:266: #### Telegram delivery targets (topics / forum threads)\r\nC:\\Users\\yanmeizhao\\AppData\\Roaming\\npm\\node_modules\\openclaw\\docs\\automation\\cron-jobs.md:268: Telegram supports forum topics via `message_thread_id`. For cron delivery, you can encode\r\nC:\\Users\\yanmeizhao\\AppData\\Roaming\\npm\\node_modules\\openclaw\\docs\\automation\\cron-jobs.md:275: Prefixed targets like `telegram:...` / `telegram:group:...` are also accepted:\r\nC:\\Users\\yanmeizhao\\AppData\\Roaming\\npm\\node_modules\\openclaw\\docs\\automation\\cron-jobs.md:277: - `telegram:group:-1001234567890:topic:123`\r\nC:\\Users\\yanmeizhao\\AppData\\Roaming\\npm\\node_modules\\openclaw\\docs\\automation\\cron-jobs.md:575: Recurring isolated job (deliver to a Telegram topic):\r\nC:\\Users\\yanmeizhao\\AppData\\Roaming\\npm\\node_modules\\openclaw\\docs\\automation\\cron-jobs.md:585:   --channel telegram \\\r\nC:\\Users\\yanmeizhao\\AppData\\Roaming\\npm\\node_modules\\openclaw\\docs\\automation\\cron-jobs.md:671: ### Telegram delivers to the wrong place\r\nC:\\Users\\yanmeizhao\\AppData\\Roaming\\npm\\node_modules\\openclaw\\docs\\automation\\cron-jobs.md:674: - If you see `telegram:...` prefixes in logs or stored “last route” targets, that’s normal;\r\nC:\\Users\\yanmeizhao\\AppData\\Roaming\\npm\\node_modules\\openclaw\\docs\\automation\\hooks.md:225:     commandSource?: string,    // e.g., 'whatsapp', 'telegram'\r\nC:\\Users\\yanmeizhao\\AppData\\Roaming\\npm\\node_modules\\openclaw\\docs\\automation\\hooks.md:289:   channelId: string,      // Channel (e.g., \"whatsapp\", \"telegram\", \"discord\")\r\nC:\\Users\\yanmeizhao\\AppData\\Roaming\\npm\\node_modules\\openclaw\\docs\\automation\\hooks.md:311:   channelId: string,      // Channel (e.g., \"whatsapp\", \"telegram\", \"discord\")\r\nC:\\Users\\yanmeizhao\\AppData\\Roaming\\npm\\node_modules\\openclaw\\docs\\automation\\hooks.md:324:   channelId: string,      // Channel (e.g., \"telegram\", \"whatsapp\")\r\nC:\\Users\\yanmeizhao\\AppData\\Roaming\\npm\\node_modules\\openclaw\\docs\\automation\\hooks.md:334:   channelId: string,      // Channel (e.g., \"telegram\", \"whatsapp\")\r\nC:\\Users\\yanmeizhao\\AppData\\Roaming\\npm\\node_modules\\openclaw\\docs\\automation\\hooks.md:596: - **Source**: telegram\r\nC:\\Users\\yanmeizhao\\AppData\\Roaming\\npm\\node_modules\\openclaw\\docs\\automation\\hooks.md:671: {\"timestamp\":\"2026-01-16T14:30:00.000Z\",\"action\":\"new\",\"sessionKey\":\"agent:main:main\",\"senderId\":\"+1234567890\",\"source\":\"telegram\"}\r\nC:\\Users\\yanmeizhao\\AppData\\Roaming\\npm\\node_modules\\openclaw\\docs\\automation\\poll.md:13: - Telegram\r\nC:\\Users\\yanmeizhao\\AppData\\Roaming\\npm\\node_modules\\openclaw\\docs\\automation\\poll.md:21: # Telegram\r\nC:\\Users\\yanmeizhao\\AppData\\Roaming\\npm\\node_modules\\openclaw\\docs\\automation\\poll.md:22: openclaw message poll --channel telegram --target 123456789 \\\r\nC:\\Users\\yanmeizhao\\AppData\\Roaming\\npm\\node_modules\\openclaw\\docs\\automation\\poll.md:24: openclaw message poll --channel telegram --target -1001234567890:topic:42 \\\r\nC:\\Users\\yanmeizhao\\AppData\\Roaming\\npm\\node_modules\\openclaw\\docs\\automation\\poll.md:47: - `--channel`: `whatsapp` (default), `telegram`, `discord`, or `msteams`\r\nC:\\Users\\yanmeizhao\\AppData\\Roaming\\npm\\node_modules\\openclaw\\docs\\automation\\poll.md:50: - `--poll-duration-seconds`: Telegram-only (5-600 seconds)\r\nC:\\Users\\yanmeizhao\\AppData\\Roaming\\npm\\node_modules\\openclaw\\docs\\automation\\poll.md:51: - `--poll-anonymous` / `--poll-public`: Telegram-only poll visibility\r\nC:\\Users\\yanmeizhao\\AppData\\Roaming\\npm\\node_modules\\openclaw\\docs\\automation\\poll.md:64: - `durationSeconds` (number, optional, Telegram-only)\r\nC:\\Users\\yanmeizhao\\AppData\\Roaming\\npm\\node_modules\\openclaw\\docs\\automation\\poll.md:65: - `isAnonymous` (boolean, optional, Telegram-only)"}],"details":{"status":"completed","exitCode":0,"durationMs":2251,"aggregated":"C:\\Users\\yanmeizhao\\AppData\\Roaming\\npm\\node_modules\\openclaw\\docs\\date-time.md:120: - Telegram/WhatsApp: provider-specific numeric/ISO timestamps\r\nC:\\Users\\yanmeizhao\\AppData\\Roaming\\npm\\node_modules\\openclaw\\docs\\docs.json:4:   \"description\": \"Self-hosted gateway that connects WhatsApp, Telegram, Discord, iMessage, and more to AI coding agents. Run a single Gateway process on your own machine and message your AI assistant from anywhere.\",\r\nC:\\Users\\yanmeizhao\\AppData\\Roaming\\npm\\node_modules\\openclaw\\docs\\docs.json:140:       \"destination\": \"/channels/telegram\"\r\nC:\\Users\\yanmeizhao\\AppData\\Roaming\\npm\\node_modules\\openclaw\\docs\\docs.json:171:       \"source\": \"/providers/telegram\",\r\nC:\\Users\\yanmeizhao\\AppData\\Roaming\\npm\\node_modules\\openclaw\\docs\\docs.json:172:       \"destination\": \"/channels/telegram\"\r\nC:\\Users\\yanmeizhao\\AppData\\Roaming\\npm\\node_modules\\openclaw\\docs\\docs.json:368:       \"destination\": \"/channels/telegram\"\r\nC:\\Users\\yanmeizhao\\AppData\\Roaming\\npm\\node_modules\\openclaw\\docs\\docs.json:372:       \"destination\": \"/channels/telegram\"\r\nC:\\Users\\yanmeizhao\\AppData\\Roaming\\npm\\node_modules\\openclaw\\docs\\docs.json:643:       \"source\": \"/telegram\",\r\nC:\\Users\\yanmeizhao\\AppData\\Roaming\\npm\\node_modules\\openclaw\\docs\\docs.json:644:       \"destination\": \"/channels/telegram\"\r\nC:\\Users\\yanmeizhao\\AppData\\Roaming\\npm\\node_modules\\openclaw\\docs\\docs.json:916:                   \"channels/telegram\",\r\nC:\\Users\\yanmeizhao\\AppData\\Roaming\\npm\\node_modules\\openclaw\\docs\\docs.json:1514:                   \"zh-CN/channels/telegram\",\r\nC:\\Users\\yanmeizhao\\AppData\\Roaming\\npm\\node_modules\\openclaw\\docs\\index.md:28:   <strong>Any OS gateway for AI agents across WhatsApp, Telegram, Discord, iMessage, and more.</strong><br />\r\nC:\\Users\\yanmeizhao\\AppData\\Roaming\\npm\\node_modules\\openclaw\\docs\\index.md:46: OpenClaw is a **self-hosted gateway** that connects your favorite chat apps — WhatsApp, Telegram, Discord, iMessage, and more — to AI coding agents like Pi. You run a single Gateway process on your own machine (or a server), and it becomes the bridge between your messaging apps and an always-available AI assistant.\r\nC:\\Users\\yanmeizhao\\AppData\\Roaming\\npm\\node_modules\\openclaw\\docs\\index.md:53: - **Multi-channel**: one Gateway serves WhatsApp, Telegram, Discord, and more simultaneously\r\nC:\\Users\\yanmeizhao\\AppData\\Roaming\\npm\\node_modules\\openclaw\\docs\\index.md:77:     WhatsApp, Telegram, Discord, and iMessage with a single Gateway process.\r\nC:\\Users\\yanmeizhao\\AppData\\Roaming\\npm\\node_modules\\openclaw\\docs\\index.md:163:   <Card title=\"Channels\" href=\"/channels/telegram\" icon=\"message-square\">\r\nC:\\Users\\yanmeizhao\\AppData\\Roaming\\npm\\node_modules\\openclaw\\docs\\index.md:164:     Channel-specific setup for WhatsApp, Telegram, Discord, and more.\r\nC:\\Users\\yanmeizhao\\AppData\\Roaming\\npm\\node_modules\\openclaw\\docs\\logging.md:76: To filter channel activity (WhatsApp/Telegram/etc), use:\r\nC:\\Users\\yanmeizhao\\AppData\\Roaming\\npm\\node_modules\\openclaw\\docs\\logging.md:202: Flags are case-insensitive and support wildcards (e.g. `telegram.*` or `*`).\r\nC:\\Users\\yanmeizhao\\AppData\\Roaming\\npm\\node_modules\\openclaw\\docs\\logging.md:207:     \"flags\": [\"telegram.http\"]\r\nC:\\Users\\yanmeizhao\\AppData\\Roaming\\npm\\node_modules\\openclaw\\docs\\logging.md:215: OPENCLAW_DIAGNOSTICS=telegram.http,telegram.payload\r\nC:\\Users\\yanmeizhao\\AppData\\Roaming\\npm\\node_modules\\openclaw\\docs\\pi.md:129: │   ├── telegram-actions.ts\r\nC:\\Users\\yanmeizhao\\AppData\\Roaming\\npm\\node_modules\\openclaw\\docs\\pi.md:246: 4. **Channel Tools**: Discord/Telegram/Slack/WhatsApp-specific action tools\r\nC:\\Users\\yanmeizhao\\AppData\\Roaming\\npm\\node_modules\\openclaw\\docs\\tts.md:13: It works anywhere OpenClaw can send audio; Telegram gets a round voice-note bubble.\r\nC:\\Users\\yanmeizhao\\AppData\\Roaming\\npm\\node_modules\\openclaw\\docs\\tts.md:318: - **Telegram**: Opus voice note (`opus_48000_64` from ElevenLabs, `opus` from OpenAI).\r\nC:\\Users\\yanmeizhao\\AppData\\Roaming\\npm\\node_modules\\openclaw\\docs\\tts.md:326:   - Telegram `sendVoice` accepts OGG/MP3/M4A; use OpenAI/ElevenLabs if you need\r\nC:\\Users\\yanmeizhao\\AppData\\Roaming\\npm\\node_modules\\openclaw\\docs\\tts.md:330: OpenAI/ElevenLabs formats are fixed; Telegram expects Opus for voice-note UX.\r\nC:\\Users\\yanmeizhao\\AppData\\Roaming\\npm\\node_modules\\openclaw\\docs\\tts.md:391: result is Telegram-compatible, the tool includes `[[audio_as_voice]]` so\r\nC:\\Users\\yanmeizhao\\AppData\\Roaming\\npm\\node_modules\\openclaw\\docs\\tts.md:392: Telegram sends a voice bubble.\r\nC:\\Users\\yanmeizhao\\AppData\\Roaming\\npm\\node_modules\\openclaw\\docs\\.i18n\\zh-CN.tm.jsonl:122: {\"cache_key\":\"1c540694a0b8ce10fc354bd7f41b387f1d72d1759ffecbf35976cdf744305f0e\",\"segment_id\":\"index.md:cec2be6f871d276b\",\"source_path\":\"index.md\",\"text_hash\":\"cec2be6f871d276b45d13e3010c788f01b03ae2f1caca3264bbf759afacace46\",\"text\":\"Telegram Bot\",\"translated\":\"Telegram 机器人\",\"provider\":\"pi\",\"model\":\"claude-opus-4-5\",\"src_lang\":\"en\",\"tgt_lang\":\"zh-CN\",\"updated_at\":\"2026-02-01T12:49:34Z\"}\r\nC:\\Users\\yanmeizhao\\AppData\\Roaming\\npm\\node_modules\\openclaw\\docs\\.i18n\\zh-CN.tm.jsonl:175: {\"cache_key\":\"272018c637ad26ec5622a5e164be99ef742f22f1cc1f14d3af9256471c3dbe98\",\"segment_id\":\"index.md:acdd1e734125f341\",\"source_path\":\"index.md\",\"text_hash\":\"acdd1e734125f341604c0efbabdcc4c4b0597e8f6235d66c2445edd1812838c1\",\"text\":\"Telegram\",\"translated\":\"Telegram\",\"provider\":\"pi\",\"model\":\"claude-opus-4-5\",\"src_lang\":\"en\",\"tgt_lang\":\"zh-CN\",\"updated_at\":\"2026-02-01T12:53:13Z\"}\r\nC:\\Users\\yanmeizhao\\AppData\\Roaming\\npm\\node_modules\\openclaw\\docs\\.i18n\\zh-CN.tm.jsonl:182: {\"cache_key\":\"28006596cdda45f4da3d43d4aca5bf66c459d4553682e2dd295c7e256c0a7dc6\",\"segment_id\":\"start/wizard.md:8999c63d838a1729\",\"source_path\":\"start/wizard.md\",\"text_hash\":\"8999c63d838a1729c88f4334c6fd73d735c69659f7e08989bd9d4bd0cc644748\",\"text\":\" Node (recommended; required for WhatsApp/Telegram). Bun is \",\"translated\":\" Node（推荐；WhatsApp/Telegram 需要）。Bun \",\"provider\":\"pi\",\"model\":\"claude-opus-4-5\",\"src_lang\":\"en\",\"tgt_lang\":\"zh-CN\",\"updated_at\":\"2026-02-01T13:45:33Z\"}\r\nC:\\Users\\yanmeizhao\\AppData\\Roaming\\npm\\node_modules\\openclaw\\docs\\.i18n\\zh-CN.tm.jsonl:226: {\"cache_key\":\"30df5b02209abc9fe6dad8f8edb5d9e1ecc23a3dafd5c4df988491ab87667a35\",\"segment_id\":\"start/wizard.md:acdd1e734125f341\",\"source_path\":\"start/wizard.md\",\"