526fff31f4fa0a98e4e135e0610652867bd8842a6abeb821e02ee87842bb96\",\"text\":\"Telegram DM tip:\",\"translated\":\"Telegram 私信提示：\",\"provider\":\"pi\",\"model\":\"claude-opus-4-5\",\"src_lang\":\"en\",\"tgt_lang\":\"zh-CN\",\"updated_at\":\"2026-02-01T13:37:33Z\"}\r\nC:\\Users\\yanmeizhao\\AppData\\Roaming\\npm\\node_modules\\openclaw\\docs\\.i18n\\zh-CN.tm.jsonl:1010: {\"cache_key\":\"c3c32ca9a6e0b7331bd674903379664ef8c5ab9f675dbb531062af512452343e\",\"segment_id\":\"index.md:acdd1e734125f341\",\"source_path\":\"index.md\",\"text_hash\":\"acdd1e734125f341604c0efbabdcc4c4b0597e8f6235d66c2445edd1812838c1\",\"text\":\"Telegram\",\"translated\":\"Telegram\",\"provider\":\"pi\",\"model\":\"claude-opus-4-5\",\"src_lang\":\"en\",\"tgt_lang\":\"zh-CN\",\"updated_at\":\"2026-02-01T13:04:46Z\"}\r\nC:\\Users\\yanmeizhao\\AppData\\Roaming\\npm\\node_modules\\openclaw\\docs\\.i18n\\zh-CN.tm.jsonl:1040: {\"cache_key\":\"c982edd40183708dbf5bc791228db4bfd5b4b33d5a623e1173ee48a697e31c6f\",\"segment_id\":\"index.md:f12242785ecda793\",\"source_path\":\"index.md\",\"text_hash\":\"f12242785ecda7935ded50cd48418357d32d3bac290f7a199bc9f0c7fbd13123\",\"text\":\") — Location parsing (Telegram + WhatsApp)\",\"translated\":\"）—— 位置解析（Telegram + WhatsApp）\",\"provider\":\"pi\",\"model\":\"claude-opus-4-5\",\"src_lang\":\"en\",\"tgt_lang\":\"zh-CN\",\"updated_at\":\"2026-02-01T12:54:56Z\"}\r\nC:\\Users\\yanmeizhao\\AppData\\Roaming\\npm\\node_modules\\openclaw\\docs\\.i18n\\zh-CN.tm.jsonl:1148: {\"cache_key\":\"deab7aa2d56c6fe242f6f04eef414a3fed9e1ac64374fcba6ed245d7b2733f6b\",\"segment_id\":\"start/getting-started.md:e0626242c2ea510e\",\"source_path\":\"start/getting-started.md\",\"text_hash\":\"e0626242c2ea510e9457d6fb1b2848fe7091b10201c13d28c9774e6450ad28b2\",\"text\":\": WhatsApp QR login, Telegram/Discord bot tokens, Mattermost plugin tokens, etc.\",\"translated\":\"：WhatsApp 二维码登录、Telegram/Discord 机器人令牌、Mattermost 插件令牌等。\",\"provider\":\"pi\",\"model\":\"claude-opus-4-5\",\"src_lang\":\"en\",\"tgt_lang\":\"zh-CN\",\"updated_at\":\"2026-02-01T13:36:11Z\"}\r\nC:\\Users\\yanmeizhao\\AppData\\Roaming\\npm\\node_modules\\openclaw\\docs\\.i18n\\zh-CN.tm.jsonl:1191: {\"cache_key\":\"e6e456289628d5a4b6cbbc0fbb263d656ba7d49427a2009ce3c5f608b8505ea0\",\"segment_id\":\"index.md:f0d82ba647b4a33d\",\"source_path\":\"index.md\",\"text_hash\":\"f0d82ba647b4a33da3008927253f9bed21e380f54eab0608b1136de4cbff1286\",\"text\":\"OpenClaw bridges WhatsApp (via WhatsApp Web / Baileys), Telegram (Bot API / grammY), Discord (Bot API / channels.discord.js), and iMessage (imsg CLI) to coding agents like \",\"translated\":\"OpenClaw 将 WhatsApp（通过 WhatsApp Web / Baileys）、Telegram（Bot API / grammY）、Discord（Bot API / channels.discord.js）和 iMessage（imsg CLI）桥接到编程 智能体，例如 \",\"provider\":\"pi\",\"model\":\"claude-opus-4-5\",\"src_lang\":\"en\",\"tgt_lang\":\"zh-CN\",\"updated_at\":\"2026-02-01T12:58:56Z\"}\r\nC:\\Users\\yanmeizhao\\AppData\\Roaming\\npm\\node_modules\\openclaw\\docs\\.i18n\\zh-CN.tm.jsonl:1298: {\"cache_key\":\"faae749a1e3720731bd89450cc30ca39d65ca2d3968ac048373c3f6ba5087381\",\"segment_id\":\"start/getting-started.md:9c7c1a1750d380e8\",\"source_path\":\"start/getting-started.md\",\"text_hash\":\"9c7c1a1750d380e8b4f5329437dd3e6066f20891e74af700595ddf8a5eac42a3\",\"text\":\"Bun warning (WhatsApp + Telegram):\",\"translated\":\"Bun 警告（WhatsApp + Telegram）：\",\"provider\":\"pi\",\"model\":\"claude-opus-4-5\",\"src_lang\":\"en\",\"tgt_lang\":\"zh-CN\",\"updated_at\":\"2026-02-01T13:37:01Z\"}\r\nC:\\Users\\yanmeizhao\\AppData\\Roaming\\npm\\node_modules\\openclaw\\docs\\automation\\cron-jobs.md:252: - `delivery.channel`: `whatsapp` / `telegram` / `discord` / `slack` / `mattermost` (plugin) / `signal` / `imessage` / `last`.\r\nC:\\Users\\yanmeizhao\\AppData\\Roaming\\npm\\node_modules\\openclaw\\docs\\automation\\cron-jobs.md:264: - Telegram topics should use the `:topic:` form (see below).\r\nC:\\Users\\yanmeizhao\\AppData\\Roaming\\npm\\node_modules\\openclaw\\docs\\automation\\cron-jobs.md:266: #### Telegram delivery targets (topics / forum threads)\r\nC:\\Users\\yanmeizhao\\AppData\\Roaming\\npm\\node_modules\\openclaw\\docs\\automation\\cron-jobs.md:268: Telegram supports forum topics via `message_thread_id`. For cron delivery, you can encode\r\nC:\\Users\\yanmeizhao\\AppData\\Roaming\\npm\\node_modules\\openclaw\\docs\\automation\\cron-jobs.md:275: Prefixed targets like `telegram:...` / `telegram:group:...` are also accepted:\r\nC:\\Users\\yanmeizhao\\AppData\\Roaming\\npm\\node_modules\\openclaw\\docs\\automation\\cron-jobs.md:277: - `telegram:group:-1001234567890:topic:123`\r\nC:\\Users\\yanmeizhao\\AppData\\Roaming\\npm\\node_modules\\openclaw\\docs\\automation\\cron-jobs.md:575: Recurring isolated job (deliver to a Telegram topic):\r\nC:\\Users\\yanmeizhao\\AppData\\Roaming\\npm\\node_modules\\openclaw\\docs\\automation\\cron-jobs.md:585:   --channel telegram \\\r\nC:\\Users\\yanmeizhao\\AppData\\Roaming\\npm\\node_modules\\openclaw\\docs\\automation\\cron-jobs.md:671: ### Telegram delivers to the wrong place\r\nC:\\Users\\yanmeizhao\\AppData\\Roaming\\npm\\node_modules\\openclaw\\docs\\automation\\cron-jobs.md:674: - If you see `telegram:...` prefixes in logs or stored “last route” targets, that’s normal;\r\nC:\\Users\\yanmeizhao\\AppData\\Roaming\\npm\\node_modules\\openclaw\\docs\\automation\\hooks.md:225:     commandSource?: string,    // e.g., 'whatsapp', 'telegram'\r\nC:\\Users\\yanmeizhao\\AppData\\Roaming\\npm\\node_modules\\openclaw\\docs\\automation\\hooks.md:289:   channelId: string,      // Channel (e.g., \"whatsapp\", \"telegram\", \"discord\")\r\nC:\\Users\\yanmeizhao\\AppData\\Roaming\\npm\\node_modules\\openclaw\\docs\\automation\\hooks.md:311:   channelId: string,      // Channel (e.g., \"whatsapp\", \"telegram\", \"discord\")\r\nC:\\Users\\yanmeizhao\\AppData\\Roaming\\npm\\node_modules\\openclaw\\docs\\automation\\hooks.md:324:   channelId: string,      // Channel (e.g., \"telegram\", \"whatsapp\")\r\nC:\\Users\\yanmeizhao\\AppData\\Roaming\\npm\\node_modules\\openclaw\\docs\\automation\\hooks.md:334:   channelId: string,      // Channel (e.g., \"telegram\", \"whatsapp\")\r\nC:\\Users\\yanmeizhao\\AppData\\Roaming\\npm\\node_modules\\openclaw\\docs\\automation\\hooks.md:596: - **Source**: telegram\r\nC:\\Users\\yanmeizhao\\AppData\\Roaming\\npm\\node_modules\\openclaw\\docs\\automation\\hooks.md:671: {\"timestamp\":\"2026-01-16T14:30:00.000Z\",\"action\":\"new\",\"sessionKey\":\"agent:main:main\",\"senderId\":\"+1234567890\",\"source\":\"telegram\"}\r\nC:\\Users\\yanmeizhao\\AppData\\Roaming\\npm\\node_modules\\openclaw\\docs\\automation\\poll.md:13: - Telegram\r\nC:\\Users\\yanmeizhao\\AppData\\Roaming\\npm\\node_modules\\openclaw\\docs\\automation\\poll.md:21: # Telegram\r\nC:\\Users\\yanmeizhao\\AppData\\Roaming\\npm\\node_modules\\openclaw\\docs\\automation\\poll.md:22: openclaw message poll --channel telegram --target 123456789 \\\r\nC:\\Users\\yanmeizhao\\AppData\\Roaming\\npm\\node_modules\\openclaw\\docs\\automation\\poll.md:24: openclaw message poll --channel telegram --target -1001234567890:topic:42 \\\r\nC:\\Users\\yanmeizhao\\AppData\\Roaming\\npm\\node_modules\\openclaw\\docs\\automation\\poll.md:47: - `--channel`: `whatsapp` (default), `telegram`, `discord`, or `msteams`\r\nC:\\Users\\yanmeizhao\\AppData\\Roaming\\npm\\node_modules\\openclaw\\docs\\automation\\poll.md:50: - `--poll-duration-seconds`: Telegram-only (5-600 seconds)\r\nC:\\Users\\yanmeizhao\\AppData\\Roaming\\npm\\node_modules\\openclaw\\docs\\automation\\poll.md:51: - `--poll-anonymous` / `--poll-public`: Telegram-only poll visibility\r\nC:\\Users\\yanmeizhao\\AppData\\Roaming\\npm\\node_modules\\openclaw\\docs\\automation\\poll.md:64: - `durationSeconds` (number, optional, Telegram-only)\r\nC:\\Users\\yanmeizhao\\AppData\\Roaming\\npm\\node_modules\\openclaw\\docs\\automation\\poll.md:65: - `isAnonymous` (boolean, optional, Telegram-only)","cwd":"C:\\Users\\yanmeizhao\\.openclaw\\workspace"},"isError":false,"timestamp":1773033273326}}
