{"type":"message","id":"4ef0894f","parentId":"e94c6eb5","timestamp":"2026-03-09T05:38:30.991Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_qm4TmR3X6WMp9SkDfNFZ4bDC|fc_07961f4b2477b7ba0169ae5ccbd0688191a770c56fecd1051c","name":"write","arguments":{"file_path":"C:\\Users\\yanmeizhao\\.openclaw\\workspace\\skills\\finance-official-research\\references\\source-map.md","content":"# Official Source Map\n\nUse this file to decide where to verify facts.\n\n## 1. China equities / issuers\n\nPrimary sources:\n- SSE (Shanghai Stock Exchange)\n- SZSE (Shenzhen Stock Exchange)\n- BSE (Beijing Stock Exchange)\n- CNINFO / 巨潮资讯\n- Issuer investor-relations site\n- CSRC notices\n\nTypical fact-to-source mapping:\n- financial statements -> annual/interim/quarterly report\n- dividend / buyback / placement / material events -> exchange announcement\n- risk warning / delisting / regulatory measures -> exchange + CSRC\n- index membership / methodology -> CSI or official index provider\n\n## 2. China funds / ETFs\n\nPrimary sources:\n- Fund manager official site\n- Prospectus / fund contract / summary docs\n- Annual, interim, quarterly reports\n- Exchange disclosures for listed funds\n- AMAC / CSRC when regulatory status matters\n\nTypical fact-to-source mapping:\n- investment objective / benchmark / fees -> prospectus or official factsheet\n- top holdings / sector allocation -> latest fund report\n- manager / custodian / contract amendment -> official announcements\n- ETF creation-redemption / listing matters -> exchange and manager notices\n\n## 3. US / global equities\n\nPrimary sources:\n- SEC EDGAR\n- issuer IR site\n- official exchange releases when relevant\n\nTypical fact-to-source mapping:\n- revenue / EPS / segments / cash flow -> 10-K / 10-Q / 20-F / 6-K\n- buybacks / dividends / material events -> 8-K / issuer release\n- risk factors -> annual filing\n\n## 4. US / global funds / ETFs\n\nPrimary sources:\n- sponsor official site\n- SEC filings\n- prospectus / SAI / shareholder reports\n\nTypical fact-to-source mapping:\n- mandate / benchmark / fees -> prospectus\n- holdings -> official holdings disclosure or report\n- AUM / shares / flows -> sponsor materials if officially published\n\n## 5. Red-flag checklist before answering\n\nCheck for these mistakes:\n- Is the ticker/exchange correct?\n- Is the source official?\n- Is there a newer filing?\n- Is the number audited or unaudited?\n- Is the date clearly stated?\n- Is the metric point-in-time or period-based?\n- Are you comparing like-for-like periods?\n- For funds: are holdings stale due to reporting lag?\n\n## 6. If official source is unavailable\n\nSay explicitly:\n- official source not confirmed\n- what was found instead\n- why that is insufficient for a firm conclusion\n- what exact document would be needed next\n"},"partialJson":"{\"file_path\":\"C:\\\\Users\\\\yanmeizhao\\\\.openclaw\\\\workspace\\\\skills\\\\finance-official-research\\\\references\\\\source-map.md\",\"content\":\"# Official Source Map\\n\\nUse this file to decide where to verify facts.\\n\\n## 1. China equities / issuers\\n\\nPrimary sources:\\n- SSE (Shanghai Stock Exchange)\\n- SZSE (Shenzhen Stock Exchange)\\n- BSE (Beijing Stock Exchange)\\n- CNINFO / 巨潮资讯\\n- Issuer investor-relations site\\n- CSRC notices\\n\\nTypical fact-to-source mapping:\\n- financial statements -> annual/interim/quarterly report\\n- dividend / buyback / placement / material events -> exchange announcement\\n- risk warning / delisting / regulatory measures -> exchange + CSRC\\n- index membership / methodology -> CSI or official index provider\\n\\n## 2. China funds / ETFs\\n\\nPrimary sources:\\n- Fund manager official site\\n- Prospectus / fund contract / summary docs\\n- Annual, interim, quarterly reports\\n- Exchange disclosures for listed funds\\n- AMAC / CSRC when regulatory status matters\\n\\nTypical fact-to-source mapping:\\n- investment objective / benchmark / fees -> prospectus or official factsheet\\n- top holdings / sector allocation -> latest fund report\\n- manager / custodian / contract amendment -> official announcements\\n- ETF creation-redemption / listing matters -> exchange and manager notices\\n\\n## 3. US / global equities\\n\\nPrimary sources:\\n- SEC EDGAR\\n- issuer IR site\\n- official exchange releases when relevant\\n\\nTypical fact-to-source mapping:\\n- revenue / EPS / segments / cash flow -> 10-K / 10-Q / 20-F / 6-K\\n- buybacks / dividends / material events -> 8-K / issuer release\\n- risk factors -> annual filing\\n\\n## 4. US / global funds / ETFs\\n\\nPrimary sources:\\n- sponsor official site\\n- SEC filings\\n- prospectus / SAI / shareholder reports\\n\\nTypical fact-to-source mapping:\\n- mandate / benchmark / fees -> prospectus\\n- holdings -> official holdings disclosure or report\\n- AUM / shares / flows -> sponsor materials if officially published\\n\\n## 5. Red-flag checklist before answering\\n\\nCheck for these mistakes:\\n- Is the ticker/exchange correct?\\n- Is the source official?\\n- Is there a newer filing?\\n- Is the number audited or unaudited?\\n- Is the date clearly stated?\\n- Is the metric point-in-time or period-based?\\n- Are you comparing like-for-like periods?\\n- For funds: are holdings stale due to reporting lag?\\n\\n## 6. If official source is unavailable\\n\\nSay explicitly:\\n- official source not confirmed\\n- what was found instead\\n- why that is insufficient for a firm conclusion\\n- what exact document would be needed next\\n\"}"}],"api":"openai-codex-responses","provider":"openai-codex","model":"gpt-5.4","usage":{"input":131,"output":618,"cacheRead":40832,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":41581,"cost":{"input":0.00022925,"output":0.008652,"cacheRead":0.007145599999999999,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0.01602685}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1773034696516}}
