{"type":"message","id":"0ee3fe16","parentId":"8fa10f47","timestamp":"2026-03-09T05:38:37.511Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_pVZW9wQCbiYQ6Y41XWixzb91|fc_07961f4b2477b7ba0169ae5cda57c88191b89e0a130f18bcad","name":"write","arguments":{"file_path":"C:\\Users\\yanmeizhao\\.openclaw\\workspace\\skills\\finance-official-research\\references\\answer-template.md","content":"# High-Stakes Answer Template\n\nUse this template when the user may rely on the answer for investment decisions.\n\n## Template\n\n结论：\n- ...\n- ...\n\n官方依据：\n- 事实/指标：\n- 数值/内容：\n- 时点：\n- 来源：\n\n- 事实/指标：\n- 数值/内容：\n- 时点：\n- 来源：\n\n分析解读：\n- ...\n- ...\n\n风险与不确定性：\n- ...\n- ...\n\n仍需核验：\n- ...\n\n## Style rules\n\n- Put facts before interpretation.\n- Every important number needs a source and date.\n- If data may be stale, say so in the first half of the answer.\n- If latest official disclosure was not found, avoid definitive language.\n- Distinguish company facts from market-price judgment.\n- Distinguish fund disclosed holdings from current real-time exposure.\n"},"partialJson":"{\"file_path\":\"C:\\\\Users\\\\yanmeizhao\\\\.openclaw\\\\workspace\\\\skills\\\\finance-official-research\\\\references\\\\answer-template.md\",\"content\":\"# High-Stakes Answer Template\\n\\nUse this template when the user may rely on the answer for investment decisions.\\n\\n## Template\\n\\n结论：\\n- ...\\n- ...\\n\\n官方依据：\\n- 事实/指标：\\n- 数值/内容：\\n- 时点：\\n- 来源：\\n\\n- 事实/指标：\\n- 数值/内容：\\n- 时点：\\n- 来源：\\n\\n分析解读：\\n- ...\\n- ...\\n\\n风险与不确定性：\\n- ...\\n- ...\\n\\n仍需核验：\\n- ...\\n\\n## Style rules\\n\\n- Put facts before interpretation.\\n- Every important number needs a source and date.\\n- If data may be stale, say so in the first half of the answer.\\n- If latest official disclosure was not found, avoid definitive language.\\n- Distinguish company facts from market-price judgment.\\n- Distinguish fund disclosed holdings from current real-time exposure.\\n\"}"}],"api":"openai-codex-res